@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@token = replace-with-access-token
@recipeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Smart search: FTS, nutrition, ingredients and sorting
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/recipes?q=pho%20bo&minCalories=200&maxCalories=800&includeIngredients=thit%20bo&sortBy=relevance&page=1&pageSize=20

### Search suggestions
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/suggestions?q=pho

### List recipe revisions
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/revisions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Compare revisions
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/revisions/compare?v1=1&v2=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Roll back a recipe revision
POST {{baseUrl}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/revisions/2/rollback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Moderator pending queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/moderation/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve a recipe
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/moderation/recipes/{{recipeId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
